  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00000",
      "en_US": "Muhaha!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I feel it!\r",
        "The twinkle in your eyes!\n",
        "The twinkle of friendship!\r",
        "You’re quite something.\n",
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} is quite a Pokémon!\r",
        "It’s ready to participate in the\n",
        "Pokéathlon, bud!\r",
        "Most of all, your solidarity with and\n",
        "trust of Pokémon makes me\f",
        "believe in infinite potential!\r",
        "All right. Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "What do you think?\n",
        "This is the Pokéathlon Dome!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokéathlon is a sports festival for\n",
        "Trainers and Pokémon!\r",
        "Inside the Dome are various challenges\n",
        "awaiting Trainers and Pokémon to test\f",
        "their friendship.\f",
        "Why don’t you try it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re amazing, bud!\n",
        "This is a pleasant surprise!\r",
        "To see a Pokéathlete with strong\n",
        "potential is such a pleasure! I’m glad\f",
        "I held the Pokéathlon here in Johto.\r",
        "...My name is Magnus.\n",
        "We shall meet again, bud.\r",
        "Magnus: See you, young Pokéathlete!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I feel it!\r",
        "The twinkle in your eyes!\n",
        "The twinkle of friendship!\r",
        "You’re ready to participate in the\n",
        "Pokéathlon, bud!\r",
        "Most of all, your mutual trust and\n",
        "teamwork with Pokémon makes me\f",
        "believe anything is possible!\r",
        "All right. Follow me, bud!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00006",
      "en_US": "Hmmm...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Running and jumping and...\n",
        "There are so many events for Pokémon\f",
        "to choose from. Which one should I try?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00008",
      "en_US": "ODDISH: Odd! Odd!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00009",
      "en_US": "There is more to Pokémon than battling!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00010",
      "en_US": "MEOWTH: Nyaah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s not good at battles...but no\n",
        "Pokémon can beat it at running, thanks\f",
        "to the walk we take every morning!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Huff huff!\n",
        "Everyday training is the sure way\f",
        "to glory!\r",
        "Dashing 1,000 times!\n",
        "That’s my goal for now.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s your goal?\n",
        "Having a goal lets you enjoy life more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "............\n",
        "Oh, you have done the dash 1,000 times?\r",
        "I thought it was basically impossible,\n",
        "but you make me feel courageous.\r",
        "Thank you!\n",
        "Please take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve become your fan! I would run\n",
        "anywhere for you!\f",
        "I’ll be supporting you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00016",
      "en_US": "PIDGEY: Po po!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you heard of Aprijuice?\r",
        "Pokémon can increase their Performance\n",
        "with food and drink.\r",
        "Aprijuice is a drink developed from\n",
        "nutrition research to improve\f",
        "Performance.\r",
        "If you let your Pokémon drink it before\n",
        "a Pokéathlon event, it will show its\f",
        "true potential!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00018",
      "en_US": "SLOWBRO: Whick!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Each Pokémon has its unique traits.\r",
        "A true Pokéathlete knows them and lets\n",
        "the true Performance of his or her\f",
        "Pokémon emerge!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00020",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Machao!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "They look good today!\r",
        "They weren’t so well yesterday, but\n",
        "we’ll win today for sure!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00022",
      "en_US": "SLOWPOKE: Moah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00023",
      "en_US": "FARFETCH’D: Teree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00024",
      "en_US": "PSYDUCK: Guack!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Energy drink!\n",
        "Welcome to the Aprijuice stand!\r",
        "Are you giving your Pokémon Aprijuice?\n",
        "I can explain anything you\f",
        "need to know about it! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Energy drink!\n",
        "Welcome to the Aprijuice stand!\r",
        "Huh? What’s that confused look about?\n",
        "You don’t know about Aprijuice?\f",
        "There, take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Apriblender!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "You put away the Apriblender\n",
        "in the Apricorn Box.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "When you have the Apriblender, you can\n",
        "make Aprijuice to let your Pokémon show\f",
        "their true potential!\r",
        "It’s so easy to make! All you have to\n",
        "do is to put Apricorns in the\f",
        "Apriblender. Put in as many as you can!\r",
        "The more, the merrier!\n",
        "Then you walk!\r",
        "You can run if you want...\n",
        "98...99...100 steps!\r",
        "Here! Then you open it, give it to your\n",
        "Pokémon, or drink it yourself.\r",
        "You can buy Aprijuice here.\n",
        "Why don’t you try and see how it works?\r",
        "Do you have any more questions? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Aprijuice improves a Pokémon’s\n",
        "Performance! Pokémon have strengths\f",
        "and weaknesses.\r",
        "But there is no need to worry. Give it\n",
        "Aprijuice, and you can max out its\f",
        "Performance!\r",
        "You will need it!\r",
        "Do you have any more questions? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0137_D49_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Choose from the three Apriblenders.\r",
        "The labels tell you what kind of drink\n",
        "it is. Different drinks have\f",
        "different effects.\r",
        "You should use them to suit the event\n",
        "you want to participate in. That’s how\f",
        "to make a top Pokéathlete.\r",
        "But remember this!\n",
        "If your Pokémon’s Performance is maxed\f",
        "out, you cannot make it higher.\r",
        "You should check your Pokémon’s\n",
        "Performance before you\f",
        "give it Aprijuice.\r",
        "Do you have any more questions? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
